From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:40:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: capture the screen from the post blend input

A scaled composite capture needs a full framebuffer read on the render
thread, and during playback it blends that over VD1. VD1 holds the
picture at the frame origin over NV12 zero, so LEDs fed from it show
green beside the picture. The vdin1 post blend input carries video and
GUI as on screen, scaled by vdin, at the output rate.
